valueMap.description:
Optional per-slot value remapping applied after attributeMap. Keys are slot names; each value is a map from the resolved (lowercased) raw NFT attribute value to a replacement. Replacement types: string (new archetype), number or boolean (converted to string for lookup, then cast for storage via slotTypes), null (skip the slot entirely — no trait stored, no stats applied). A "*" key acts as a wildcard/catch-all for values not explicitly listed. When there is no matching key and no "*", the raw value passes through unchanged.

Example:
```json
{
  "leader": { "yes": "faction_leader", "no": "common", "*": "common" },
  "level":  { "*": null }
}
```
